{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线首先落在左上方大号浅紫标题“舍不得被当作自己人的日子”，随后落到同样醒目的“一阵心慌”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"模糊抓到对曾经被当作自己人的日子有所留恋，具体此刻遭遇了什么不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"心慌、留恋。\",\n  \"missed\": \"那扇门再次出现却不再像从前一样召唤；重新面对过去那个不知所措的自己，知道了过去经历后，问题仍没有简单答案。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"大号主标题偏抽象，表达了与归属感有关的留恋，但单看不能明确此刻的具体处境。\",\n    \"小节标题“一阵心慌”直接给出情绪，却没有说明情绪产生的原因。\",\n    \"核心处境分散在正文多句中，需要把标题、小节名和正文拼接起来，才能理解重新面对过去的自己与心慌之间的关系。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ff838717-6c68-464c-8b26-9ffee7551f36", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T022507565778Z", "elapsed_seconds": 42.0, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:25:49.569683+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1b4b7fc54c7d333816d5981cbbd0e1a0d8ab2e4f53724f2273c21d8a22549dff", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\